     1,
     "Thanks for the response. I don&#39;t think will give me the functionality I&#39;m looking for, so let me be a little more specific. What I really want to do is to  return the corresponding data frame depending upon which input has changed most recently.<div><br></div><div>What I really need is this:</div><div><br></div><div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">output$my.table &lt;- renderDataTable({ <br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">   input$a</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">   input$b</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">   if( mostRecent(input$a) ) {</font></div></div>"
    ],
