     1,
     "<div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">      return(dataFrameA)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">   } else {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">      return(dataFrameB)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  }</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">})</font></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><br><br>On Tuesday, August 12, 2014 8:20:54 AM UTC-4, Sigbert Klinke wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">What about the following?<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">  doA </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>     input$a<br>     </span><span style=\"color:#008\">do</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> something</span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\">       </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># maybe with isolate(input$b)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  doB </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>     input$b<br>     </span><span style=\"color:#008\">do</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> something </span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><code><span style=\"color:#800\"># maybe with isolate(input$a)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></code>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  output$my</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">table </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderDataTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>     doa </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> doA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>     dob </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> doB</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>     </span><span style=\"color:#008\">do</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> the rest </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><br></div></blockquote></div>"
